        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to the Canis System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunge into the chaotic Canis System, where only the sharpest pilots rise to glory. <i>Stars of Strife</i> is a heart-pounding single-player arcade shooter inspired by legends like <i>Galaga</i>, <i>Space War</i>, and <i>Space Invaders</i>. As a rookie mercenary hired by the local government, you’ll battle relentless foes to secure your place among the stars. Crush rebel uprisings, outwit tech-stealing pirates, and face a sinister alien threat lurking in the void. Rack up points, dominate the leaderboards, and etch your name as the galaxy’s deadliest pilot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade-Perfect Controls</strong>: Master your ship with pinpoint precision. Dodge bullet barrages, unleash devastating attacks, and weave through chaos to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Enemy Waves</strong>: Face off against diverse factions, from desperate rebels with stolen weaponry to cunning pirates and a mysterious alien force with cryptic motives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Planetary Battlegrounds</strong>: Conquer unique missions across five vibrant planets, each culminating in epic boss fights that test your skill and reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chase High Scores</strong>: Compete for galactic glory with a dynamic score system to prove you’re the best.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Heart, Modern Soul</strong>: Relive arcade classics with stunning visuals, a pulse-pounding soundtrack, and addictive gameplay that’s easy to learn but tough to master.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to the Canis System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunge into the chaotic Canis System, where only the sharpest pilots rise to glory. <i>Stars of Strife</i> is a heart-pounding single-player arcade shooter inspired by legends like <i>Galaga</i>, <i>Space War</i>, and <i>Space Invaders</i>. As a rookie mercenary hired by the local government, you’ll battle relentless foes to secure your place among the stars. Crush rebel uprisings, outwit tech-stealing pirates, and face a sinister alien threat lurking in the void. Rack up points, dominate the leaderboards, and etch your name as the galaxy’s deadliest pilot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade-Perfect Controls</strong>: Master your ship with pinpoint precision. Dodge bullet barrages, unleash devastating attacks, and weave through chaos to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Enemy Waves</strong>: Face off against diverse factions, from desperate rebels with stolen weaponry to cunning pirates and a mysterious alien force with cryptic motives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Planetary Battlegrounds</strong>: Conquer unique missions across five vibrant planets, each culminating in epic boss fights that test your skill and reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chase High Scores</strong>: Compete for galactic glory with a dynamic score system to prove you’re the best.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Heart, Modern Soul</strong>: Relive arcade classics with stunning visuals, a pulse-pounding soundtrack, and addictive gameplay that’s easy to learn but tough to master.</p></li></ul>",
